        "original_id": "6953a745-a414-5cea-84a0-317a6c239be7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: It's Alive, Cheiron Studios\n- Places: Stockholm\n- Concepts: glam metal, hair metal, pop metal, heavy metal, glam rock\n- Products: Earthquake Visions\n\nFacts:\n- It's Alive was a Swedish glam-style funk metal band formed in Stockholm in 1985.\n- Glam metal, also called hair metal and often used synonymously with pop metal, is a subgenre of heavy metal with pop-influenced hooks and guitar riffs that borrows from 1970s glam rock fashion.\n- In 1994, It's Alive recorded the album Earthquake Visions for Cheiron Studios.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
